14:["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-8 text-[15px] leading-[1.8] text-[var(--text-primary)] [text-wrap:pretty]","children":"This Privacy Policy explains how Emergences AI, Inc. (“NeoWork”, “we”, “us”) handles personal data in connection with the NeoWork hiring and assessment platform at hiring.neo-work.ai and the candidate assessment experience at app.neo-work.ai (together, the “Platform”). It applies to the recruiters and administrators who use the Platform (“Customer Users”) and to the candidates who are evaluated through it (“Candidates”). Capitalized terms not defined here have the meaning given in our Terms of Service."}]
